  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prov scholarships MEC - Support MEC</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Prov. stipendier MEC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective with the contribution was to:
- &#x201c;increase the levels of participation in higher education;
- to grant scholarships to individuals who were committed to the development of their provinces; to reduce disparities in participation between males and females, and geographical regions and rural and urban communities; and
- to provide effective, equitable and well-targeted financial assistance for needy students, by financial hardship, from participating in higher education&#x201d;.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The provincial scholarship programme covers scholarships on grant     basis to higher education in Mozambique including master programs and secondary education level 2. The programme covers 7 provinces -N3     financed by Sida (Niassa, Zambezia and Sofala). The objective is to   assists students from families with lower income.The World Bank and   NL are also a partner to the programme.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The provincial scholarship programme covers scholarships on grant     basis to higher education in Mozambique including master programs and secondary education level 2. The programme covers 7 provinces -N3     financed by Sida (Niassa, Zambezia and Sofala). The objective is to   assists students from families with lower income.The World Bank and   NL are also a partner to the programme.</narrative>
  </description>
